cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, together with Yan et al. (2026) for the data and Birk et al. (2026) for TERRA."
type: software
title: "terra-ligand-perturbation: zero-shot in silico ligand perturbation in spatial transcriptomics using TERRA"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline for zero-shot in silico perturbation of a ligand in the spatial
  neighbourhood of receiving cells with the pretrained spatial
  transcriptomics foundation model TERRA. Perturbations are built by editing
  the tokenised neighbour blocks of ligand-expressing cells and compared with
  rank-matched null-gene edits and positive and negative controls, using a
  leave-one-donor-out classifier readout and embedding-shift magnitudes.
authors:
